# Photographs and generated previews are private-by-default wherever they are
# placed. Product artwork can still be added deliberately with `git add -f`.
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.webp
*.heic
!web/icons/*.png
# Product screenshots, rendered from a consented photograph that is never shown.
!docs/screenshots/*.png
# Clean product artwork for the public portfolio. Only processed geometry is shown.
!docs/portfolio/*.png

# Reference material collected from Pinterest: other people's work, kept
# locally to inspire the filters. It is not ours, so it never enters the
# repository -- not even a private one, so that habit cannot carry it in on
# the day the repository becomes public.
samples/

# The test photographs are of real people, children among them. They stay on
# disk, never in the repository.
photos/

# The first screenshot set, made from real photographs before the product was
# renamed. Superseded by docs/screenshots and kept only on disk.
portfolio-screenshots/
portfolio-screenshots.zip
